{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_031_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:896aad0e1bec3132d36bf42b01d0bec0d9b999f075efe0aec090c72a079a7db0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d235a0bb2466ca859cbd91749ebb9a93157c1d73760097af35dfd4f579f8ac69",
      "text": "哇！●●●●プロデューサー，\n这难道是情人节巧克力？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c5e575c1bac96e4873aa27258aa3453dea2a30c46788b0bf4d949f25d685fdc",
      "text": "超级超级开心！\n我现在整个人都幸福咲啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c75e6398d735f17c24905cd38f61f2650e3a6125ac87a8a617b401ea427cb81",
      "text": "早知道我也准备好巧克力带来就好了～！\n噗～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46b883efc8d701b21c2605b173b918059003a4c8b543d147c102ace9b74313c8",
      "text": "白色情人节我绝对会回礼的！\n要等我哦，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02a6734976dbd5eaad6c8c678fe979ba84965ab787126f6a0a9cb92ffcef609b",
      "text": "啊，差点忘了！\n谢谢你送的超棒巧克力！我会好好品尝的☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9da7d65ef1d3e4f9963673e93ebb08dc39726071e4ae2ea7becbf797aa7525d6",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，这是……\n情人节的巧克力对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e77419f5f6d9baedb8abbc88d2b92dba3c5fa5ef2ad70cec7146e01df6e4510",
      "text": "呀——！不敢相信～！这是给我的吗？\n超级超级开心，谢谢你啦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edf709da3578a96f324bc087e3ce8ae85927528d4eca8643b85845a6174239e5",
      "text": "是制作人特意为了我\n挑选的巧克力啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a653fad7bf3c0620bbb5a81bd2739b11b06b6b76e9b9d784708cce14d1cabaa",
      "text": "总觉得马上吃掉有点太可惜了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_b:cmd-000037:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96a73060f9712a917865065fcafc9c01e9fd4e95c406715842ee3cfd10973e82",
      "text": "我懂。确实会有这种时候呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_b:cmd-000038:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8f9208a645f283d727a70ea4aa0adada7f9d974e7434638bed410f5f16227d1",
      "text": "太好了！请趁新鲜吃哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6598d9536c8203f32c611da7599119cc9d13697e39116c4ad8f3385fbe8adae0",
      "text": "对吧……有了！趁现在多拍点\n照片留念吧☆ 这样就算吃掉了也留得住回忆嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6598d9536c8203f32c611da7599119cc9d13697e39116c4ad8f3385fbe8adae0",
      "text": "对吧……有了！趁现在多拍点\n照片留念吧☆ 这样就算吃掉了也留得住回忆嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:383ed4fd791fb69528d1eff7b692719ad5683697580011a953dde1d511f4de7b",
      "text": "喂喂，制作人也一起来合影吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fac2a34d9d43097acc97dbfdffc177c3f1824c321ba44bb0baafc405bf79e354",
      "text": "难得是从制作人那里收到巧克力的特别的\n情人节，我想好好记录下来嘛☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_22:5_01_031_22_b:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:275e90e9145dc7dda8c6a7ac706baef4e0aeebbe5e74872fcdf6ff9279be9da6",
      "text": "再靠过来一点～……好，笑一个♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
